WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.900
As protesters

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.267
keep on

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.102
with the fight for freedom

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.103
in Iran, the hardline

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.637
government continues its crackdown.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.573
And CNN just spoke to one of thousands

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.540
of brave demonstrators.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.675
A man who barely escaped

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.476
death, barely

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:10.844
managed to escape the country

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:11.745
with bullet fragments

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.780
still lodged inside him.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.249
Yet he is vowing to return and fight on.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.785
CNN's Jomana Karasheh has the exclusive.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:19.586
And we want to warn you,

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.855
some of the images you'll see are graphic

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.926
It was one of the most terrifying videos

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.194
to emerge from Iran.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.130
A protester surrounded by armed

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.264
regime forces

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.333
trying to send them off with a knife

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.303
Shots are fired

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:40.473
before he falls to his knees.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.142
That's the latest

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.444
to talk to us more ashcan what he wants.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.945
He later appeared in intensive

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:46.513
care,

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:47.781
barely conscious

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.916
with his parents by his side.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.785
2002 so young.

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:53.853
I had a severed artery in my leg.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.722
I had around 200 shotgun

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.157
pellets in my body.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.125
I had serious wounds

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.427
even after I surrendered.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:01.728
And they arrested me.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:02.662
They beat me around

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.464
100 times in the head

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.900
and the rest of my body with batons.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.435
When they were transporting me

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:09.502
to the hospital,

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.538
they shot me from a very close range

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:12.806
with a shotgun.

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:14.240
They thought that I'll be dead.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.476
More of them. But Ashkan survived.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:17.310
And with him,

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.612
a tale of unimaginable horror.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.115
I don't think money.

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:23.416
I was the man who died

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.185
and was brought back to life

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.853
as I am speaking with you.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.322
I still have 20 shotgun pellets

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.291
still lodged in my body.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.492
He escaped Iran

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.294
Now a wanted man in hiding.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.528
Speaking exclusively

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.330
to CNN for his safety.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.166
He won't say where he is. Won't be easy.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.601
I got out of the country

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.269
through mountains and deserts

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.472
while heavily bleeding and in very,

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.474
very bad condition.

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:49.275
I died so many times

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.910
before I got out of the country.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.145
As he lay in hospital

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.079
hanging on to life

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:53.813
by a thread,

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:55.448
he was charged with Mahavir

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.283
waging war against God,

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.551
a crime punishable by

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:00.253
death in the Islamic Republic

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:02.122
regime.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:04.190
Agents raided this hospital and dragged

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:05.692
Ashkan to jail.

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:06.826
As always,

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:07.861
when someone is taken

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.863
from the ICU straight to prison,

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:12.465
this is kind of a death sentence

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.500
in prison.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.268
I went through unbearable agony

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.370
because all my wounds were open.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.006
I used salt to try to disinfect my wounds

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.374
just a little bit.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:22.942
They badly tormented me.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:24.511
They sent me to an army hospital

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:26.980
that was not equipped to treat me.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.381
I was there in that condition

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.350
with both my hands and feet

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.618
chained to the bed.

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:32.452
Every day.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:34.921
People of his Kurdish town

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:37.023
of Shenandoah protested for his release.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.158
His family paid

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.759
all they have to bail him out

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:41.161
for medical treatment.

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.428
And with the help of friends,

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:45.331
he made it out of Iran.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.734
I was a professional boxer, a fighter.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.903
I was so eager about my future

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:50.670
and had a plan

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.972
to pursue this sport as a career.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.174
But because my leg

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.475
and the rest of my body

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.177
has been severely injured,

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:58.578
I can't do that anymore.

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:03.483
Being away from my

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.051
family and all the pressure

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.085
that they have endured

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.888
because of me is mentally tormenting me.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.290
I'm not feeling

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.424
okay physically

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:13.593
or mentally on my side and stuff.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.563
What do you want the world to know

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.364
about what is happening inside

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:19.299
Iran right now?

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:21.434
Hey, y'all I'm sorry, man.

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:22.735
There are so many like me

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:25.038
who sadly gave their life,

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:27.373
but their voice didn't reach outside.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:28.474
There are so many brave

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:30.810
girls and boys inside Iran

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.678
are only crying

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.047
is that we demand freedom and democracy

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.481
and want our women

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:37.350
to be equal to our men.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:40.053
We shouted Woman life, freedom

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:41.688
And their response to us

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:42.789
is only bullet,

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:44.924
only torturing, raping prisoners.

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:48.161
I saw many young people.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:50.663
16, 17 year olds get killed.

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:52.232
They killed so many.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.334
They blinded so many.

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:55.168
I swear to God,

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.402
I can't sleep at night

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.004
thinking about those things.

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:58.705
Now that I'm lost, the

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.441
Ashkan remains undeterred.

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.442
Once he recovers,

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:04.510
he says he's ready to go back

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.779
and continue the fight for free.

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:07.747
Iran.

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:08.881
Each pressing one.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.283
I have no regrets.

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:12.452
And I am proud of what I did.

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:14.454
I will give my life for my people,

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:15.588
for my Iran.

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:17.991
Not one time, but 100,000.

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.959
You don't need to

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:21.527
And Jomana Karadsheh

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.463
joins us now live from Istanbul.

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.631
I mean, it's remarkable

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:26.399
he was able to get out.

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:27.100
Can you

00:04:27.233 --> 00:04:28.001
can you give us a broader

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:28.835
sense of what's happening

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:29.535
there on the ground?

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:31.871
With other protesters now?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.174
Absolutely, Anderson.

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:36.342
I mean, we have to first mention

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:37.310
that we did reach out

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.244
to the Iranian government

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.545
for comment on our report

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.947
and on Ash Khan's case,

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:41.948
they did not respond

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:44.417
to CNN's requests for comment.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:46.486
The protests have subsided

00:04:46.486 --> 00:04:47.420
for the most part.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.421
We are still seeing

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:50.423
some sporadic demonstrations

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:51.391
taking place, mostly

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:52.292
in parts of the country

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.426
that are home to the country's

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:54.360
Sunni minority.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:54.794
And tonight,

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:55.662
we're getting reports

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:58.231
of some protests in the Kurdistan region.

00:04:58.231 --> 00:05:00.133
But in other parts of the country,

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.067
the protest movement

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:03.169
has really been pushed underground.

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:04.737
And people will tell you it's

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:06.572
because of several factors.

00:05:06.572 --> 00:05:07.774
The weather being one, it's

00:05:07.774 --> 00:05:09.275
snowing, it's freezing.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.677
You've also got

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:11.411
air pollution

00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:12.879
that has shut down several cities.

00:05:12.879 --> 00:05:16.349
But also the regime's ruthless response

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:17.583
to these demonstrations,

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:18.718
that brutal crackdown

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:20.219
has had a chilling effect.

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:21.020
You've got thousands

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.221
who've been arrested, hundreds

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:22.755
who've been killed,

00:05:22.755 --> 00:05:24.223
including many children.

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:25.692
At least four protesters

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:26.592
have been executed.

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:27.593
Many others

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:28.661
facing the death penalty

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:29.762
after what rights groups say.

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:31.964
Are these fast tracked sham trials?

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:33.800
That has had a chilling effect.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.134
But protesters in Iran

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:37.770
we have spoken to say this is not over.

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:39.172
They say it's far from over.

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.341
They're saying this is a pause

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:43.876
The grievances are still there.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.878
They say the anger has increased

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.380
and it's a matter of time

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.149
before these countrywide protests resume.

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:50.583
They say

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:51.584
some are describing

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:52.819
the situation, Anderson,

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:54.520
as this raging fire

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.922
under the ashes right now.

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:57.123
Jomana Karadsheh, I appreciate it.

00:05:57.123 --> 00:05:57.523
Thank you.

